{"text":"<p></p><p></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wdfrZ8C0-co</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3.128152\">00:03</span> ### Dhammānulomapaccanīye dukatikapaṭṭhānaṃ ^7-67-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-1. Hetuduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-67a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Kusalapadaṃ ^7-67b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-67c-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10.257235\">00:10</span> 1. Hetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nakusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nanahetu nakusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuṃ kusalañca nahetuṃ kusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nakusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (cittasamuṭṭhānameva, ārammaṇaṃ natthi). ^7-67c-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"39.896411\">00:39</span> Hetuyā tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi…pe… nissayavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"49.910253\">00:49</span> 2. Hetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa nakusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-67c-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"59.49234\">00:59</span> Hetu kusalo dhammo nahetussa nakusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"68.264248\">01:08</span> Nahetu kusalo dhammo nanahetussa nakusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"77.827055\">01:17</span> Hetu kusalo ca nahetu kusalo ca dhammā nahetussa nakusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"88.416914\">01:28</span> 3. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate tīṇi. (Pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-67c-3</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Akusalapadaṃ ^7-67d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"98.356495\">01:38</span> 4. Hetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naakusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-67d-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"108.638659\">01:48</span> Nahetuṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naakusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"117.757367\">01:57</span> Hetuṃ akusalañca nahetuṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naakusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) Hetuyā tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi…pe… nissayavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"137.857305\">02:17</span> 5. Hetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa naakusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-67d-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"147.923948\">02:27</span> Hetu akusalo dhammo nahetussa naakusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"157.583823\">02:37</span> Nahetu akusalo dhammo nanahetussa naakusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"166.981388\">02:46</span> Hetu akusalo ca nahetu akusalo ca dhammā nahetussa naakusalassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"177.875844\">02:57</span> 6. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate tīṇi. ^7-67d-6</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Abyākatapadaṃ ^7-67e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Paccayavāro ^7-67f-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"184.305102\">03:04</span> 7. Nahetuṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paccayā nanahetu naabyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. (Nissayavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) ^7-67f-7</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-2. Hetuduka-vedanāttikaṃ ^7-67g-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"199.850313\">03:19</span> 8. Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-67g-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"214.708396\">03:34</span> Nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>Hetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca nahetuṃ sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi.</span></p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"235.888713\">03:55</span> 9. Hetuṃ dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nadukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) Hetuyā tīṇi. (Sabbattha vitthāro.) ^7-67g-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"253.840983\">04:13</span> 10. Hetuṃ adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naadukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) Hetuyā tīṇi. (Sabbattha vitthāro.) ^7-67g-10</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-3. Hetuduka-vipākattikaṃ ^7-67h-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"270.89513\">04:30</span> 11. Hetuṃ vipākaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu navipāko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67h-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"282.124994\">04:42</span> Hetuṃ vipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu navipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"291.348558\">04:51</span> Nahetuṃ nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammaṃ paṭicca nanahetu nanevavipākanavipākadhammadhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-4. Hetuduka-upādinnattikaṃ ^7-67i-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"305.114023\">05:05</span> 12. Hetuṃ upādinnupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naupādinnupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67i-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"318.869335\">05:18</span> Nahetuṃ anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nanahetu naanupādinnaanupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"333.868503\">05:33</span> Hetuṃ anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naanupādinnaanupādāniyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-5. Hetuduka-saṃkiliṭṭhattikaṃ ^7-67j-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"345.333201\">05:45</span> 13. Hetuṃ saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67j-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"358.706565\">05:58</span> Nahetuṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nanahetu naasaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"371.075693\">06:11</span> Hetuṃ asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naasaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Hetuduka-vitakkattikaṃ ^7-67k-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"383.063253\">06:23</span> 14. Hetuṃ savitakkasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasavitakkasavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67k-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"396.70868\">06:36</span> Hetuṃ avitakkavicāramattaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naavitakkavicāramatto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"407.583874\">06:47</span> Nahetuṃ avitakkaavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nanahetu naavitakkaavicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Hetuduka-pītittikaṃ ^7-67l-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"417.846359\">06:57</span> 15. Hetuṃ pītisahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu napītisahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67l-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"427.207824\">07:07</span> Hetuṃ sukhasahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasukhasahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"436.480621\">07:16</span> Hetuṃ upekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naupekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-8. Hetuduka-dassanattikaṃ ^7-67m-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"446.933702\">07:26</span> 16. Hetuṃ dassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nadassanena pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67m-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"460.538689\">07:40</span> Hetuṃ bhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nabhāvanāya pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"471.643584\">07:51</span> Nahetuṃ nevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paccayā nanahetu nanevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-9. Hetuduka-dassanahetuttikaṃ ^7-67n-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"488.064613\">08:08</span> 17. Hetuṃ dassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nadassanena pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67n-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"499.959124\">08:19</span> Hetuṃ bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"512.339085\">08:32</span> Hetuṃ nevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nanevadassanena nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuyā ekaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-10. Hetuduka-ācayagāmittikaṃ ^7-67o-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"529.492939\">08:49</span> 18. Hetuṃ ācayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naācayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67o-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"542.736765\">09:02</span> Hetuṃ apacayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naapacayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"555.299279\">09:15</span>  Nahetuṃ nevācayagāmināpacayagāmiṃ dhammaṃ paccayā nanahetu nanevācayagāmināpacayagāmī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-11. Hetuduka-sekkhattikaṃ ^7-67p-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"571.612758\">09:31</span> 19. Hetuṃ sekkhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasekkho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67p-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"580.095065\">09:40</span> Hetuṃ asekkhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naasekkho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"588.642326\">09:48</span> Nahetuṃ nevasekkhanāsekkhaṃ dhammaṃ paccayā nanahetu nanevasekkhanāsekkho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-12. Hetuduka-parittattikaṃ ^7-67q-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"601.1817\">10:01</span> 20. Nahetuṃ parittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nanahetu naparitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (tīṇi). ^7-67q-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"614.173023\">10:14</span> Hetuṃ mahaggataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu namahaggato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"622.757725\">10:22</span> Hetuṃ appamāṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naappamāṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-13. Hetuduka-parittārammaṇattikaṃ ^7-67r-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"632.215457\">10:32</span> 21. Hetuṃ parittārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naparittārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (tīṇi). ^7-67r-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"642.077059\">10:42</span> Hetuṃ mahaggatārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu namahaggatārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (tīṇi).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"652.48759\">10:52</span> Hetuṃ appamāṇārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naappamāṇārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-14. Hetuduka-hīnattikaṃ ^7-67s-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"663.118521\">11:03</span> 22. Hetuṃ hīnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nahīno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67s-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"674.035881\">11:14</span> Nahetuṃ majjhimaṃ dhammaṃ paccayā nanahetu namajjhimo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"682.746146\">11:22</span> Hetuṃ paṇītaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu napaṇīto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-15. Hetuduka-micchattaniyatattikaṃ ^7-67t-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"691.637666\">11:31</span> 23. Hetuṃ micchattaniyataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu namicchattaniyato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (tīṇi). ^7-67t-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"701.182256\">11:41</span> Hetuṃ sammattaniyataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasammattaniyato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā … (tīṇi).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"710.724752\">11:50</span> Nahetuṃ aniyataṃ dhammaṃ paccayā nanahetu naaniyato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-16. Hetuduka-maggārammaṇattikaṃ ^7-67u-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"720.194509\">12:00</span> 24. Hetuṃ maggārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu namaggārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (tīṇi). ^7-67u-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"729.866881\">12:09</span> Hetuṃ maggahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu namaggahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (tīṇi).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"739.471224\">12:19</span> Hetuṃ maggādhipatiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu namaggādhipati dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-17. Hetuduka-uppannattikaṃ ^7-67v-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"748.60131\">12:28</span> 25. Hetu anuppanno dhammo nahetussa naanuppannassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā upanissaye nava. ^7-67v-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"761.069627\">12:41</span> Hetu uppādī dhammo nahetussa nauppādissa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… ārammaṇe nava.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-18. Hetuduka-atītattikaṃ ^7-67w-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"769.729901\">12:49</span> 26. Hetu atīto dhammo nahetussa naatītassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… ārammaṇe nava. ^7-67w-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"778.111754\">12:58</span> Hetu anāgato dhammo nahetussa naanāgatassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… ārammaṇe nava.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-19. Hetuduka-atītārammaṇattikaṃ ^7-67x-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"790.327244\">13:10</span> 27. Hetuṃ atītārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naatītārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-67x-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"799.919264\">13:19</span> Hetuṃ anāgatārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu naanāgatārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><